msgid "# Triton JIT warmup on Ascend"
msgstr "# 昇腾上的 Triton JIT 预热"

msgid ""
"This guide describes how to register and precompile Triton kernels during "
"vLLM-Ascend startup. Use it with the upstream [JIT Kernel Warmup "
"guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/contributing/jit_kernel_warmup/) and "
"the [vLLM revision verified by the target branch](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/.github/vllm-main-verified.commit)."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍如何在 vLLM-Ascend 启动期间注册并预编译 Triton 内核。请结合上游的 [JIT "
"内核预热指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/contributing/jit_kernel_warmup/) "
"以及[目标分支验证的 vLLM 版本](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/.github/vllm-main-verified.commit)一起使用。"

msgid "## Integration mechanism"
msgstr "## 集成机制"

msgid "| Component | Responsibility |"
msgstr "| 组件 | 职责 |"

msgid ""
"| vLLM `JitWarmupRegistry` | Collect registrations, expand compile keys and "
"deduplicate them per wrapper. |"
msgstr "| vLLM `JitWarmupRegistry` | 收集注册信息，展开编译键并按包装器去重。 |"

msgid ""
"| vLLM Triton helper | Reuse the launch specification for warmup compilation"
" and runtime execution. |"
msgstr "| vLLM Triton 辅助模块 | 复用启动规格，用于预热编译和运行时执行。 |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend runner | Activate the registry during component initialization. |"
msgstr "| 昇腾 runner | 在组件初始化期间激活注册表。 |"

msgid ""
"| `AscendTritonJitKernel` | Adapt the parallel-compilation gate for CANN. |"
msgstr "| `AscendTritonJitKernel` | 为 CANN 适配并行编译开关。 |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend `kernel_warmup()` | Complete late registration, retain Ascend "
"wrappers and invoke registry warmup. |"
msgstr "| 昇腾 `kernel_warmup()` | 完成延迟注册，保留昇腾包装器并调用注册表预热。 |"

msgid ""
"Register an `AscendTritonJitKernel` instance inside the runner's active "
"window. Registration outside a window is a no-op; the current orchestrator "
"removes instances that do not derive from the Ascend base."
msgstr ""
"在 runner 的活动窗口内注册 `AscendTritonJitKernel` "
"实例。在窗口外注册不会产生任何效果；当前编排器会移除未从昇腾基类派生的实例。"

msgid "## Startup and execution flow"
msgstr "## 启动与执行流程"

msgid ""
"1. **Initialize and register.** The runner activates its `jit_warmup_registry` while constructing selected components. Their `register_warmup(...)` calls record the wrapper and configuration; registration itself does not compile kernels.\n"
"2. **Run configured dummy inputs.** The [worker](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/worker/worker.py) runs the configured model dummy inputs. These executions can already trigger Triton compilation.\n"
"3. **Complete registration.** The worker calls [kernel_warmup(worker)](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/model_executor/warmup/kernel_warmup.py). It adds registrations that need final runtime metadata and removes wrappers that cannot compile through the Ascend base.\n"
"4. **Compile required variants.** `registry.warmup()` expands registered configurations through `get_warmup_keys`, deduplicates keys per wrapper and compiles each required variant. For a non-autotuned wrapper, the path is `compile → warmup_inputs → __call__ → launch → kernel.warmup`; it compiles without executing the kernel.\n"
"5. **Capture and serve.** The worker captures graphs when enabled. Runtime wrapper calls use real tensors and the actual grid; Triton reuses matching cached artifacts. A variant not covered by warmup can still compile on first use."
msgstr ""
"1. **初始化并注册。** runner 在构造选定组件时激活其 `jit_warmup_registry`。这些组件的 `register_warmup(...)` 调用会记录包装器和配置；注册本身不会编译内核。\n"
"2. **运行配置的 dummy 输入。** [worker](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/worker/worker.py) 运行配置的模型 dummy 输入。这些执行可能已经触发 Triton 编译。\n"
"3. **完成注册。** worker 调用 [kernel_warmup(worker)](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/model_executor/warmup/kernel_warmup.py)。它会添加需要最终运行时元数据的注册，并移除无法通过昇腾基类编译的包装器。\n"
"4. **编译所需变体。** `registry.warmup()` 通过 `get_warmup_keys` 展开已注册的配置，按包装器对键去重，并编译每个所需变体。对于非自动调优的包装器，路径为 `compile → warmup_inputs → __call__ → launch → kernel.warmup`；它只编译而不执行内核。\n"
"5. **捕获并服务。** worker 在启用时捕获图。运行时包装器调用使用真实张量和实际 grid；Triton 会复用匹配的缓存产物。未被预热覆盖的变体仍可在首次使用时编译。"

msgid ""
"`CompileKey` deduplicates warmup work; it does not replace Triton's runtime "
"specialization and cache keys."
msgstr "`CompileKey` 用于对预热工作进行去重；它不会替代 Triton 的运行时特化和缓存键。"

msgid "## Integration steps"
msgstr "## 集成步骤"

msgid "### 1. Define the warmup domain"
msgstr "### 1. 定义预热域"

msgid ""
"List the supported dtypes, constexpr values, scalar specialization classes, "
"layouts and compilation options. Generate keys for reachable variants, "
"including applicable out-of-graph paths. See [JIT specialization and "
"recompilation](../contribution/triton_operators.md#jit-specialization-and-"
"recompilation)."
msgstr ""
"列出支持的 dtype、constexpr 值、标量特化类别、布局和编译选项。为可达变体生成键，包括适用的图外路径。参见 [JIT "
"特化与重编译](../contribution/triton_operators.md#jit-specialization-and-"
"recompilation)。"

msgid "### 2. Implement the Ascend wrapper"
msgstr "### 2. 实现昇腾包装器"

msgid ""
"Derive the wrapper from [AscendTritonJitKernel](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/ascend_jit_warmup.py). "
"For an explicit-key wrapper, implement:"
msgstr ""
"从 [AscendTritonJitKernel](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/ascend_jit_warmup.py) "
"派生包装器。对于显式键包装器，需实现："

msgid "| Member | Requirement |"
msgstr "| 成员 | 要求 |"

msgid "| `kernel` | Reference the JIT kernel. |"
msgstr "| `kernel` | 引用 JIT 内核。 |"

msgid "| `CompileKey` | A hashable key identifying a required variant. |"
msgstr "| `CompileKey` | 标识所需变体的可哈希键。 |"

msgid "| `dispatch` | Map concrete dispatch inputs to a key. |"
msgstr "| `dispatch` | 将具体分派输入映射到键。 |"

msgid ""
"| `get_warmup_keys` | Generate keys from the supported configuration domain."
" |"
msgstr "| `get_warmup_keys` | 从支持的配置域生成键。 |"

msgid ""
"| `warmup_inputs` | Supply every required `__call__` argument, including "
"launch-only arguments. |"
msgstr "| `warmup_inputs` | 提供所有必需的 `__call__` 参数，包括仅用于启动的参数。 |"

msgid ""
"| `__call__` | Use `@kernel_launcher`; return the grid and launch arguments."
" |"
msgstr "| `__call__` | 使用 `@kernel_launcher`；返回 grid 和启动参数。 |"

msgid ""
"Use `TritonWarmupTensor` for compile-only tensor metadata. Match runtime "
"dtype, strides, alignment and scalar specialization. Keep operations that "
"require tensor contents outside this path."
msgstr ""
"使用 `TritonWarmupTensor` 表示仅用于编译的张量元数据。需与运行时的 "
"dtype、步长、对齐和标量特化保持一致。将需要张量内容的操作排除在此路径之外。"

msgid "### 3. Connect runtime calls"
msgstr "### 3. 连接运行时调用"

msgid ""
"Create one wrapper instance for registration and execution. In the public "
"operator function, replace direct kernel launch with the wrapper call. "
"Preserve output allocation, grid dimensions, argument binding and return "
"values."
msgstr "为注册和执行创建一个包装器实例。在公共算子函数中，用包装器调用替换直接的内核启动。保留输出分配、grid 维度、参数绑定和返回值。"

msgid "### 4. Register in the selected component"
msgstr "### 4. 在选定组件中注册"

msgid ""
"Place `register_warmup(...)` in the initialization path of the component "
"that selects and uses the operator. Pass the configuration expected by the "
"wrapper's `get_warmup_keys`."
msgstr ""
"将 `register_warmup(...)` 放在选择并使用该算子的组件的初始化路径中。传入包装器的 `get_warmup_keys` "
"所期望的配置。"

msgid "| Operator owner | Where to register or integrate | Source reference |"
msgstr "| 算子归属 | 注册或集成位置 | 源码参考 |"

msgid ""
"| Model | Register in the model layer's `__init__`, while the runner "
"constructs the model inside its registry window. | "
"`DeepseekV41Indexer.__init__` registers indexer kernels in "
"[indexer.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/models/deepseek_v41/indexer.py). |"
msgstr ""
"| 模型 | 在模型层的 `__init__` 中注册，此时 runner 在其注册表窗口内构造模型。 | "
"`DeepseekV41Indexer.__init__` 在 [indexer.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/models/deepseek_v41/indexer.py) "
"中注册 indexer 内核。 |"

msgid ""
"| Attention | Register in the selected metadata builder's `__init__`. If "
"keys need allocated cache layouts, register after allocation in the runner's"
" cache initialization window. | `AscendDSAMetadataBuilder.__init__` in "
"[dsa_v1.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/attention/dsa_v1.py); `initialize_kv_cache` in "
"the [runner](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/worker/v2/model_runner.py). |"
msgstr ""
"| 注意力 | 在选定的元数据构建器的 `__init__` 中注册。如果键需要已分配的缓存布局，则在 runner 的缓存初始化窗口中于分配之后注册。"
" | [dsa_v1.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/attention/dsa_v1.py) 中的 "
"`AscendDSAMetadataBuilder.__init__`；[runner](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/worker/v2/model_runner.py) 中的 "
"`initialize_kv_cache`。 |"

msgid ""
"| Sampling | When adding an Ascend sampling wrapper, register it during "
"initialization of the selected sampling component, inside the runner "
"registry window. | Use the [runner](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/worker/v2/model_runner.py) that constructs the "
"component; the former v1 sampling registration helper has been removed. |"
msgstr ""
"| 采样 | 添加昇腾采样封装时，应在所选采样组件的初始化过程中、于 runner 注册表窗口内完成注册。 | 使用构造该组件的 "
"[runner](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/worker/v2/model_runner.py)；原先的 v1 采样注册辅助函数已被移除。"
" |"

msgid ""
"| Worker / runner | Own registry windows and compilation timing. For keys "
"requiring final component or input-batch metadata, call a late-registration "
"helper before `registry.warmup()`. | `_register_dspark_swa_indices_warmup` "
"and `kernel_warmup` in [kernel_warmup.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/model_executor/warmup/kernel_warmup.py). |"
msgstr ""
"| Worker / runner | 负责注册表窗口和编译时机。对于需要最终组件或输入批次元数据的键，应在 `registry.warmup()` "
"之前调用延迟注册辅助函数。 | [kernel_warmup.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/model_executor/warmup/kernel_warmup.py) 中的 "
"`_register_dspark_swa_indices_warmup` 和 `kernel_warmup`。 |"

msgid ""
"| Compilation pass | If a pass introduces a wrapped Triton operator, provide"
" its key domain through an initialization or late-registration path above, "
"once its configuration is known. A graph rewrite alone does not register the"
" wrapper. | Follow the wrapper and registration steps in this guide; the "
"current Ascend compilation directory has no dedicated `register_warmup` "
"entry point. |"
msgstr ""
"| 编译 pass | 如果某个 pass 引入了被封装的 Triton "
"算子，一旦其配置确定，就应通过上述初始化或延迟注册路径提供其键域。仅靠图重写不会注册该封装。 | "
"遵循本指南中的封装和注册步骤；当前昇腾编译目录没有专用的 `register_warmup` 入口点。 |"

msgid ""
"| Runtime | Call the same wrapper instance with real tensors. Register "
"variants before serving; a runtime call alone does not populate the warmup "
"registry. | `triton_q_rms` in [rms_norm.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/rms_norm.py). |"
msgstr ""
"| 运行时 | 使用真实张量调用同一个封装实例。在服务前注册各变体；仅靠运行时调用不会填充预热注册表。 | "
"[rms_norm.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/rms_norm.py) 中的 `triton_q_rms`。 |"

msgid ""
"For the Q-RMS path, the runner's `_initialize_kv_cache_upstream` activates "
"the registry around the upstream cache initialization that constructs "
"attention metadata builders. The builder then registers the same wrapper "
"instance used by `triton_q_rms`."
msgstr ""
"对于 Q-RMS 路径，runner 的 `_initialize_kv_cache_upstream` "
"会在构造注意力元数据构建器的上游缓存初始化前后激活注册表。随后，该构建器会注册与 `triton_q_rms` 所使用的相同的封装实例。"

msgid ""
"For a new initialization path, check that the caller encloses component "
"construction in `with runner.jit_warmup_registry.activate():`. If it does "
"not, add the window at the runner call site using its existing registry. A "
"late-registration helper must also activate that same registry. Registration"
" outside a window is a no-op; importing a wrapper alone does not register "
"it."
msgstr ""
"对于新的初始化路径，请检查调用方是否将组件构造包裹在 `with runner.jit_warmup_registry.activate():` "
"中。如果没有，请在 runner "
"调用点使用其现有注册表添加该窗口。延迟注册辅助函数也必须激活同一个注册表。在窗口之外注册不会产生任何效果；仅导入封装并不会注册它。"

msgid ""
"Ordinary component registration does not require adding the operator to a "
"central list or calling `registry.warmup()` from the component. The worker "
"owns compilation timing."
msgstr "普通组件注册不需要将该算子添加到中央列表，也不需要从组件中调用 `registry.warmup()`。编译时机由 worker 负责。"

msgid "## Example: Q-RMS"
msgstr "## 示例：Q-RMS"

msgid ""
"The existing [Q-RMS implementation](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/rms_norm.py) shows the complete "
"wrapper and runtime call:"
msgstr ""
"现有的 [Q-RMS 实现](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/rms_norm.py)展示了完整的封装和运行时调用："

msgid ""
"1. `TritonQRmsKernel.CompileKey` contains `dim`, `block_m` and `dtype`.\n"
"2. `get_warmup_keys` enumerates reachable power-of-two `block_m` values up to the UB-derived bound.\n"
"3. `warmup_inputs` supplies tensor metadata and all launcher arguments, including `num_vectorcore`.\n"
"4. `triton_q_rms` calculates the runtime tile, allocates the output and calls `_TRITON_Q_RMS_KERNEL`."
msgstr ""
"1. `TritonQRmsKernel.CompileKey` 包含 `dim`、`block_m` 和 `dtype`。\n"
"2. `get_warmup_keys` 枚举可达的 2 的幂次 `block_m` 值，直至由 UB 推导出的上限。\n"
"3. `warmup_inputs` 提供张量元数据和所有启动器参数，包括 `num_vectorcore`。\n"
"4. `triton_q_rms` 计算运行时 tile、分配输出并调用 `_TRITON_Q_RMS_KERNEL`。"

msgid ""
"[AscendDSAMetadataBuilder](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/attention/dsa_v1.py) registers that instance "
"during construction:"
msgstr ""
"[AscendDSAMetadataBuilder](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/attention/dsa_v1.py) 在构造期间注册该实例："

msgid "## Validation"
msgstr "## 验证"

msgid ""
"- Verify expected keys for supported configurations and specialization boundaries.\n"
"- Verify registration inside the runner window and no registration outside it.\n"
"- Verify warmup argument binding and unchanged runtime output after wrapper migration.\n"
"- On the target device, test cold and warm caches; record compilation separately for dummy runs, explicit warmup, graph capture and serving."
msgstr ""
"- 验证受支持配置和特化边界的预期键。\n"
"- 验证在 runner 窗口内完成注册，且窗口外没有注册。\n"
"- 验证预热参数绑定，以及封装迁移后运行时输出保持不变。\n"
"- 在目标设备上测试冷缓存和热缓存；分别记录 dummy 运行、显式预热、图捕获和服务期间的编译情况。"

msgid ""
"Add tests under `tests/ut/model_executor/warmup/`. Refer to "
"[test_jit_warmup_rms.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/tests/ut/model_executor/warmup/test_jit_warmup_rms.py) for "
"keys and registration, and [test_kernel_warmup.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/tests/ut/model_executor/warmup/test_kernel_warmup.py) for "
"orchestration. In a prepared test environment, run:"
msgstr ""
"在 `tests/ut/model_executor/warmup/` 下添加测试。关于键和注册，请参考 "
"[test_jit_warmup_rms.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/tests/ut/model_executor/warmup/test_jit_warmup_rms.py)；关于编排，请参考"
" [test_kernel_warmup.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/tests/ut/model_executor/warmup/test_kernel_warmup.py)。在准备好的测试环境中运行："

msgid ""
"Mock tests validate registration and scheduling; use device tests for "
"compilation coverage and numerical correctness."
msgstr "Mock 测试验证注册和调度；使用设备测试验证编译覆盖率和数值正确性。"

msgid "## Configuration and troubleshooting"
msgstr "## 配置与故障排查"

msgid "| Setting | Behavior |"
msgstr "| 配置项 | 行为 |"

msgid ""
"| `kernel_config.enable_jit_warmup` | Enables registry warmup; defaults to "
"`True`. |"
msgstr "| `kernel_config.enable_jit_warmup` | 启用注册表预热；默认为 `True`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `VLLM_TRITON_JIT_WARMUP_NUM_THREADS` | Defaults to `4`; set to `1` for "
"serial compilation. |"
msgstr "| `VLLM_TRITON_JIT_WARMUP_NUM_THREADS` | 默认为 `4`；设置为 `1` 可进行串行编译。 |"

msgid ""
"Parallel compilation requires `AsyncCompileMode` and a non-autotuned "
"wrapper. Autotuning may execute kernels and requires suitable real inputs. "
"`enforce_eager` does not globally disable registry warmup."
msgstr ""
"并行编译需要 `AsyncCompileMode` 和非自动调优的封装。自动调优可能会执行内核，并需要合适的真实输入。`enforce_eager` "
"不会全局禁用注册表预热。"

msgid "| Symptom | Check |"
msgstr "| 现象 | 检查项 |"

msgid ""
"| Empty registry | Component selection, active window and Ascend base class "
"|"
msgstr "| 注册表为空 | 组件选择、活动窗口和昇腾基类 |"

msgid "| Warmup `TypeError` | Missing or mismatched `__call__` arguments |"
msgstr "| 预热时出现 `TypeError` | `__call__` 参数缺失或不匹配 |"

msgid ""
"| Compilation during serving | Uncovered specialization classes or missing "
"registration |"
msgstr "| 服务期间发生编译 | 未覆盖的特化类或缺少注册 |"

msgid ""
"| Incorrect runtime output | Grid, argument binding, masks and output writes"
" |"
msgstr "| 运行时输出不正确 | Grid、参数绑定、掩码和输出写入 |"

msgid ""
"| Parallel compilation failure | Retry with one thread and check compiler "
"compatibility |"
msgstr "| 并行编译失败 | 使用单线程重试并检查编译器兼容性 |"
